{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43402","headline":"鸡头 · 无名氏","name":"鸡头","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖浪参差叠寒玉，水仙晓展鉢盘绿。\n淡黄根老栗皱圆，染青刺短金罂熟。\n紫罗小囊光紧蹙，一掬真珠藏蝟腹。\n丛丛引觜傍莲洲，满川恐作天鸡哭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}